# Handwritten Character Recognition using CNN

## Project Overview
This project is developed for the CodeAlpha Machine Learning Internship.
The objective of this project is to identify handwritten characters and digits using Deep Learning techniques.

A Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) model is used with the EMNIST Balanced dataset.

---

## Features
- Handwritten Character Recognition
- CNN-based Deep Learning Model
- EMNIST Balanced Dataset
- Training and Testing
- Accuracy Evaluation
- Prediction Visualization

---

## Technologies Used
- Python
- PyTorch
- Torchvision
- Matplotlib
- Google Colab
